{"unit_id": "tag:03DT:proof", "translation": "对于<MATH_0001>，<MATH_0002>-覆盖（covering）也是 fpqc-覆盖（covering），见《拓扑（Topologies）》引理<REF_0001>、<REF_0002>、<REF_0003>、<REF_0004>及<REF_0005>的结果。因此只须对 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）证明该定理。假设<MATH_0003>为 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering），其中已给定<MATH_0004>。假设有截面（sections）族<MATH_0005>，满足<MATH_0006>。我们须找到对应的截面（section）<MATH_0007>。可将<MATH_0008>重新理解为映射（maps）族<MATH_0009>，它们与典范的（canonical）下降（descent）数据（data）相容，后者相伴于拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）<MATH_0010>与<MATH_0011>，定义在<MATH_0012>上。因此，由命题<REF_0006>，可见能将它们（唯一地）下降（descend）为映射（map）<MATH_0013>，从而得到所需的截面（section）<MATH_0014>。\n", "allowed_english": ["fpqc", "fpqc-"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "fpqc covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "fpqc covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "section", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范的"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "descend", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "section", "target_term": "截面"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "指定拓扑的覆盖，待决。"}, {"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "引用章名，待决。"}, {"source_term": "fpqc covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "fpqc 是来源中的拓扑缩写，所修饰的覆盖双语保留，待决。"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面", "context": "相容截面族，待决。"}, {"source_term": "section", "target_term": "截面", "context": "下降后所得截面，待决。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "重解释截面所得映射，待决。"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范的", "context": "由原层诱导的数据，待决。"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降", "context": "下降数据，待决。"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据", "context": "此处是下降数据的数学名词，待决。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "原概形上的两层，待决。"}, {"source_term": "descend", "target_term": "下降", "context": "将相容映射下降，待决。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "下降所得映射，待决。"}], "notes": ["remark：来源使用 correspond section，疑似语法笔误；英文冻结原字节及数学内容保持。"]}
{"unit_id": "tag:03FG:statement", "translation": "在《拓扑（Topologies）》引理<REF_0001>中，我们已看到，小 Zariski 景（small Zariski site），对于概形（scheme）<MATH_0001>而言，等价（equivalent）于作为拓扑空间（topological space）的<MATH_0002>，其含义是层（sheaves）的范畴（categories）自然等价（equivalent）。如今<MATH_0003>也配备了结构层（structure sheaf）<MATH_0004>，因而可见，环景（ringed site）<MATH_0005>上的模（modules）层（sheaves）与环空间（ringed space）<MATH_0006>上的模（modules）层（sheaves）一致。\n", "allowed_english": ["Zariski"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "small Zariski site", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "structure sheaf", "target_term": "结构层"}, {"source_term": "ringed site", "target_term": "环景"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "ringed space", "target_term": "环空间"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "引用章名，待决。"}, {"source_term": "small Zariski site", "target_term": "景", "context": "概形的小 Zariski 景，限定词在前，Zariski 为来源专名，待决。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "小景的底概形，待决。"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "层范畴的等价，待决。"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "概形底空间，待决。"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "层范畴与模层，待决。"}, {"source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "层范畴，待决。"}, {"source_term": "structure sheaf", "target_term": "结构层", "context": "小景的环结构，待决。"}, {"source_term": "ringed site", "target_term": "环景", "context": "带结构层的小景，待决。"}, {"source_t