{"unit_id": "tag:03DR:prose-0004", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。显然，给定<MATH_0002>-模（module），它位于（例如）<MATH_0003>上，其到（例如）<MATH_0004>的拉回（pullback）就是 fppf-层化（sheafification）。为考察比较大（big）景与小（small）景（sites）时的情形，我们有如下结果。\n\n", "allowed_english": ["fppf-"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "sheafification", "target_term": "层化"}, {"source_term": "big", "target_term": "大"}, {"source_term": "small", "target_term": "小"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "景"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "底概形，待决。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "给定景上的模，待决。"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回", "context": "改变拓扑后的拉回，待决。"}, {"source_term": "sheafification", "target_term": "层化", "context": "fppf 为来源中的拓扑缩写，层化逐项双语记录，待决。"}, {"source_term": "big", "target_term": "大", "context": "大景，待决。"}, {"source_term": "small", "target_term": "小", "context": "小景，待决。"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "景", "context": "比较的两类景，待决。"}], "notes": []}
